## scene mine
- dialog "本机配置":
  - text: 本机配置
  - heading "这台机器上，每个角色跑在哪" [level=2]
  - paragraph: 下拉菜单里的选项，是 MMW 刚问过这台机器上的 host 得到的，问的地方和 start 起会话时问的是同一处。这里就是 MMW 管这件事的唯一地方，保存在本机的 ~/.mmw/models.json；这一页不写 GitHub。
  - button "关闭本机配置": ×
  - text: 本机的 host 07:02 问各 host 的 CLI ·
  - button "重新扫描"
  - text: cursor 9 个 model grok 2 个 model claude 4 个 model codex 4 个 model pi orca、herdr 起不了 runner 用什么起会话
  - combobox "runner":
    - option "herdr"
    - option "orca" [selected]
    - option "paseo"
    - option "按所在环境判断"
  - paragraph: 环境变量 MMW_RUNNER 设了时，它优先于这一格。「按所在环境判断」让 start 看自己跑在哪个 runner 里，判断不出时用 orca。runner 是 paseo 时，start 向 Paseo 要 model，所以换到 paseo 或从 paseo 换走，选项会重新扫描。
  - text: 一个角色一行 agent host model effort junior-worker 贴 junior-worker label 的票
  - combobox "junior-worker 的 host":
    - option "cursor"
    - option "grok" [selected]
    - option "claude"
    - option "codex"
    - option "pi · orca、herdr 起不了" [disabled]
  - combobox "junior-worker 的 model":
    - option "grok 4.6" [selected]
    - option "grok 4.5"
  - combobox "junior-worker 的 effort":
    - option "low"
    - option "medium"
    - option "high" [selected]
    - option "xhigh"
  - text: senior-worker 贴 senior-worker label 的票
  - combobox "senior-worker 的 host":
    - option "cursor"
    - option "grok"
    - option "claude"
    - option "codex" [selected]
    - option "pi · orca、herdr 起不了" [disabled]
  - combobox "senior-worker 的 model":
    - option "gpt 6 astra"
    - option "gpt 5.6 sol" [selected]
    - option "gpt 5.6 luna"
    - option "gpt 5.5"
  - combobox "senior-worker 的 effort":
    - option "low"
    - option "medium"
    - option "high" [selected]
    - option "xhigh"
    - option "max"
    - option "ultra"
  - text: reviewer 评审每张票的改动
  - combobox "reviewer 的 host":
    - option "cursor"
    - option "grok"
    - option "claude" [selected]
    - option "codex"
    - option "pi · orca、herdr 起不了" [disabled]
  - combobox "reviewer 的 model":
    - option "opus 5" [selected]
    - option "sonnet 5"
    - option "fable 5.1"
    - option "fable 5"
  - combobox "reviewer 的 effort":
    - option "low"
    - option "medium"
    - option "high" [selected]
    - option "xhigh"
    - option "max"
  - text: verifier 复验每张票的判据
  - combobox "verifier 的 host":
    - option "cursor"
    - option "grok"
    - option "claude" [selected]
    - option "codex"
    - option "pi · orca、herdr 起不了" [disabled]
  - combobox "verifier 的 model":
    - option "opus 5"
    - option "sonnet 5" [selected]
    - option "fable 5.1"
    - option "fable 5"
  - combobox "verifier 的 effort":
    - option "low"
    - option "medium"
    - option "high" [selected]
    - option "xhigh"
    - option "max"
  - text: advisor 被问到时给第二意见
  - combobox "advisor 的 host":
    - option "cursor"
    - option "grok"
    - option "claude" [selected]
    - option "codex"
    - option "pi · orca、herdr 起不了" [disabled]
  - combobox "advisor 的 model":
    - option "opus 5"
    - option "sonnet 5"
    - option "fable 5.1" [selected]
    - option "fable 5"
  - combobox "advisor 的 effort":
    - option "low"
    - option "medium" [selected]
    - option "high"
    - option "xhigh"
    - option "max"
  - paragraph: 一台新机器第一次安装时，这里填的是 MMW 自带的初始值；之后只按这里选的跑，MMW 更新不会改它。
  - text: 没有改动 上面就是下一个新起的 agent 会用的配置。
  - button "关闭"
  - button "保存" [disabled]

